          <span class="obs" style="left:calc(${left}% - 1px)"></span></div>
        <div class="axis" aria-hidden="true"><span>${fix2(lo)}</span><span>${fix2(hi)}</span></div>
        <p class="muted small" style="margin-top:4px">Horizontal axis: share of the accounts’ actions that fall in the same tight burst.</p>
        <div class="key"><span><i style="background:#5a5650"></i>Shuffled timing</span><span><i style="background:var(--shill)"></i>Real accounts: ${fix2(nd.observed)}</span></div>
        <p class="chart-caption">We shuffled each account’s activity in time ${worlds.toLocaleString()} times.${k != null ? ` <strong>${k.toLocaleString()}</strong> of those shuffles were as synchronised as the real accounts` : ''}${timingP != null ? ` (timing p = ${pval(timingP)}).` : '.'}</p>`);
    }

